{"strongs": "H7144", "word": "קָרְחָה", "translit": "qor.chah", "root": "קרב", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "baldness, bald spot", "definition": "קָרְחָה noun feminine baldness, bald spot , made as sign of mourning; — absolute ׳ ק Isa 3:24 +; suffix קָרְחָתֵח Mic 1:16 — bald spot , עַלכָּֿלרֿאֹשׁ Amos 8:10 , ׳ בְּכָלרֿ Isa 15:2 ; Ezek 7:18 בְּראֹשׁ ׳ ק Lev 21:5 (accusative of congnate meaning with verb); ׳ כָּלרֿאֹשׁ ק Jer 48:37 כַנֶּשֶׁר ׳ ק Mic 1:16 בֵּין עֵינֵיכֶם Deut 14:1 opposed to מַעֲשֶׂה מִקְשֶׁה Isa 3:24 also Jer 47:5 and (accusative of congnate meaning with verb) Ezek 27:31 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7588')\">BDB7588</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7144')\">H7144</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7587')\">BDB7587</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7589')\">BDB7589</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קָרְחָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>baldness, bald spot</highlightword>, made as sign of mourning; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 3:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,24)\">Isa 3:24</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>קָרְחָתֵח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 1:16\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(33,1,16)\">Mic 1:16</ref> — <highlight>bald spot</highlight>, <bdbheb>עַלכָּֿלרֿאֹשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 8:10\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,10)\">Amos 8:10</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּכָלרֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 15:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,15,2)\">Isa 15:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,18)\">Ezek 7:18</ref> <bdbheb>בְּראֹשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 21:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,21,5)\">Lev 21:5</ref> (accusative of congnate meaning with verb); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כָּלרֿאֹשׁ ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 48:37\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,37)\">Jer 48:37</ref> <bdbheb>כַנֶּשֶׁר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 1:16\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(33,1,16)\">Mic 1:16</ref> <bdbheb>בֵּין עֵינֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 14:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,14,1)\">Deut 14:1</ref> opposed to <bdbheb>מַעֲשֶׂה מִקְשֶׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 3:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,24)\">Isa 3:24</ref> also <ref ref=\"Jer 47:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,47,5)\">Jer 47:5</ref> and (accusative of congnate meaning with verb) <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:31\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,31)\">Ezek 27:31</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 3:24", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 3, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Mic 1:16", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 1, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Amos 8:10", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Isa 15:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ezek 7:18", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 7, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Lev 21:5", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 21, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Jer 48:37", "book": "JER", "chapter": 48, "verse": 37}, {"raw": "Deut 14:1", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 14, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Jer 47:5", "book": "JER", "chapter": 47, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ezek 27:31", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 27, "verse": 31}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["קָרְחָה", "׳", "ק", "קָרְחָתֵח", "עַלכָּֿלרֿאֹשׁ", "בְּכָלרֿ", "בְּראֹשׁ", "כָּלרֿאֹשׁ ק", "כַנֶּשֶׁר", "בֵּין עֵינֵיכֶם", "מַעֲשֶׂה מִקְשֶׁה"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB7588", "source": "BDB", "test